{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c8c3","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b27e-c8a1-7be1-9b43-e0047ff1ed44"},"sequence":700,"recorded_at":1780531400001395,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"42a50646-ac4c-4d20-af82-db3f2b0269ba","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"42a50646-ac4c-4d20-af82-db3f2b0269ba","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"42a50646-ac4c-4d20-af82-db3f2b0269ba"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b280-8a67-7d62-9271-0be4797ea505"},"task_id":"01a0b280-8a67-7d62-9271-0be4797ea505","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b280-8a67-7d62-9271-0be4797ea505","chunk":"Read text file `internal/clonesnap/doc.go`.\n1|package clonesnap\n2|\n3|// This package implements the Section 13.14.1 native capture operation\n4|// over a real on-disk provider store: a contained capture walk that\n5|// produces the Clone Raw Object Manifest and Clone Capture Manifest\n6|// from actual bytes, classifies every Capture Item, builds the\n7|// Capture Boundary from measured evidence, detects source mutation\n8|// before any projection output, checkpoints the workspace binding\n9|// and source head, and admits stable captures to a target branch.\n10|//\n11|// Authority: relux-works/agent-session-manager-spec@v0.7.0, Sections\n12|// 7.8, 10.2, and 13.14.1 (internal/specdoc/SPEC.v0.7.0.md; the\n13|// pinned sections are byte-identical to v0.6.0).\n14|//\n15|// Every artifact this package emits is produced through the landed\n16|// clonebundle builders and validated by the landed decoders:\n17|// BuildRawObjectManifest and BuildCaptureManifest seal the\n18|// manifests, SanitizeNativeKey admits native keys,\n19|// CheckDigestsEqual decides the source-race gate,\n20|// RefuseUnstableForTarget and RefuseMaximalSafeUnlessComplete guard\n21|// target admission, and InstallRawBlob installs payload bytes. No\n22|// second manifest, boundary, blob, or identity model exists here.\n23|//\n24|// Reuse, not fork: store containment is the landed secprim Guard\n25|// discipline (every payload open descends from a verified root\n26|// handle, never by re-resolving a path string); durable writes go\n27|// only through localstore.ObjectStore.PutBlob (no-replace install,\n28|// fsync, size/digest verification); Blob Descriptors validate\n29|// through canonicaljson.CalculateObjectIdentity plus local claim\n30|// comparisons (never the attesting entry, per the provhost\n31|// no-attestation bound); capture classes admit through\n32|// clonebundle.ValidCaptureClass; the source digest and receipt bytes\n33|// seal through scalar digests and canonicaljson.Canonicalize.\n34|//\n35|// Stated bounds (sibling scope, not waived): no ax CLI, no provider\n36|// process, no network — the store is a fixture directory; Section\n37|// 7.8 capture-plan/capture/normalize operation wiring stays owned by\n38|// sessadapter (this package consumes plan keys and classes, it does\n39|// not speak the adapter protocol); projection planning past target\n40|// admission is the final leaf's (this package emits only the\n41|// admission receipt that pins G2 admission and race-before-projection\n42|// ordering); per-kind event payload registries are the normalization\n43|// sibling's. internal/traceability bindings and the re-pin ride with\n44|// the Story FINAL leaf; the clause map lives in TRACEABILITY.md.","final_result":true}}}
