{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000ccd1","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b27e-c8a1-7be1-9b43-e0047ff1ed44"},"sequence":1219,"recorded_at":1780531400002433,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"42a50646-ac4c-4d20-af82-db3f2b0269ba","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"42a50646-ac4c-4d20-af82-db3f2b0269ba","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"42a50646-ac4c-4d20-af82-db3f2b0269ba"},"call_id":"call_01a0b2849bdc7522851e440c64573672","text":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 405-414\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-// sealAndPublish seals both manifests through the landed builders,\n-// re-decodes each before publishing, publishes in raw-then-capture\n-// order through the object store, and returns the capture result.\n-// The stable proof carries the gate-verified pre digest for both\n-// capture digests: gateSourceRace proved the measured post equal\n-// before this seal ran, so the sealed bytes are identical to sealing\n-// the measurement. Sealing the raw post measurement instead would\n-// fail closed under a reorder (the landed builder refuses unequal\n-// digests) and leave the race-before-seal ordering unpinned; the\n-// N-race-order mutants prove the gate precedes this seal.\n+// sealAndPublish seals both manifests through the landed builders,\n+// re-decodes each before publishing, publishes in raw-then-capture\n+// order through the object store, and returns the capture result.\n+// The stable proof seals the two measured source digests: the race\n+// gate proved them equal before this seal ran, so on the stable\n+// path the sealed bytes equal either measurement, and the landed\n+// builder refuses unequal digests. The N-race-order mutants move\n+// the gate after this seal and the killers redden on the published\n+// manifests, which proves the gate precedes the seal.\n","edit_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","path":"internal/clonesnap/capture.go","added":9,"removed":10},"correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","outcome":"success"}}}
