{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d135","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b27e-c8a1-7be1-9b43-e0047ff1ed44"},"sequence":1781,"recorded_at":1780531400003557,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"42a50646-ac4c-4d20-af82-db3f2b0269ba","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"42a50646-ac4c-4d20-af82-db3f2b0269ba","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"42a50646-ac4c-4d20-af82-db3f2b0269ba"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b288-e2e1-78e1-b01b-772fe036ef7d"},"task_id":"01a0b288-e2e1-78e1-b01b-772fe036ef7d","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b288-e2e1-78e1-b01b-772fe036ef7d","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 89-96\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-- The sealed stable proof carries the gate-verified pre digest for\n-  both capture digests: the race gate proved the measured post\n-  equal before the seal ran, so production bytes are identical to\n-  sealing the measurement. The ordering mutants\n-  (`N-race-order-capture`, `N-race-order-project`) prove the gate\n-  precedes the seal; sealing the raw post measurement instead\n-  would fail closed under a reorder and leave the ordering\n-  unpinned.\n+- The sealed stable proof carries the two measured source digests\n+  (pre and post): the race gate proved them equal before the seal\n+  ran, so on the stable path the sealed bytes equal either\n+  measurement, and the landed builder refuses unequal digests.\n+  The ordering mutants (`N-race-order-capture`,\n+  `N-race-order-project`) move the gate after the seal and the\n+  killers redden on the published manifests and receipt, which\n+  proves the gate precedes the seal either way the digests seal.\n","final_result":true}}}
